        },
        "offer_TbnaWR": {
          "type": "offer",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>You are not limited to what you get from your initial slot car set from Joysway as they also provide additional cars as well as extra track and accessories to allow you to expand your slot car track and design the track of your dreams.</p>"
          }
        },
        "offer_3RAXjb": {
          "type": "offer",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>The track pieces are well designed and manufactured to be easy to put together and take apart as needed. The track accessories also fit well with the track to give you the result you are looking for.</p>"
